SPOILER ALERT














Scale mail gets it's name from the dragon scales used in it's manufacture. What
this means to the nethacker is that if you've got a dragon hide (dead dragon),
you can magically transform (ie: polymorph) it into dragon scale armour. Each 
different type of dragon provides armour of the corresponding colour and with 
appropriate magical abilities. 
Eg: kill a red dragon, polymorph the corpse, wear the armour, and you now have
intrinsic fire resistance.
